# The record of every experiment is the ledger plus the rooms, both tracked (2026-09-16: this
# is an experimental project, nothing on the shelf is private). What stays out is running
# state — a beat, a pid — the trash, and the html pages, rebuilt off the ledger in a second.
shelf/sittings/.trash/
shelf/artifacts/.trash/
shelf/berserk/heartbeat
shelf/berserk/state.json
shelf/berserk/pages/
# The dream stream is disposable by decision (bekh, 2026-09-19): 288 pages a day written by
# nobody, of which almost all are read once or not at all. What survives is what he STARS —
# a keep syncs an artifact under shelf/artifacts/, which is tracked and pushed. The rooms,
# the ledger and the heartbeat are all running state and none of them is in git.
shelf/sittings/stream/
shelf/stream/
